  "id": "intensive-care-syndrome",
  "term": "intensive care syndrome",
  "definition": "Intensive care syndrome, more specifically post-intensive care syndrome, refers to physical, psychological, and cognitive problems that develop during an ICU stay and may continue after leaving intensive care or after hospital discharge. It can affect the quality of life of both ICU survivors and their families.",
